### Restore a deleted material (within the 7-day grace window)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/materials/{{material_id}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get suggested minimum stock (default MONTH window)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/materials/{{material_id}}/suggested-minimum
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get suggested minimum stock (specific window)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/materials/{{material_id}}/suggested-minimum?window=THREE_MONTHS
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get audit log for a material
GET http://localhost:8080/api/materials/{{material_id}}/audit-log
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get all schedule slots with ADMIN token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get schedule slots by group
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/groups/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get schedule slots by day
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/days/MONDAY
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get schedule slots by group and day
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/groups/1/days/MONDAY
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Create schedule slot with ADMIN token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "primaryStaffId": 1,
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "10:00:00",
  "activityTitle": "Actividad educativa",
  "roomName": "Aula principal",
  "notes": "Actividad demo creada desde api-test.http"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("schedule_slot_id", response.body.scheduleSlotId);
%}

###

### Get schedule slot by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/{{schedule_slot_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Update schedule slot with ADMIN token
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/{{schedule_slot_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "primaryStaffId": 1,
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "startTime": "09:30:00",
  "endTime": "10:30:00",
  "activityTitle": "Actividad educativa actualizada",
  "roomName": "Aula principal",
  "notes": "Horario demo actualizado desde api-test.http"
}

###

### Assign primary staff to schedule slot
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/{{schedule_slot_id}}/primary-staff/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Delete schedule slot (soft-delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/{{schedule_slot_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### List schedule slots including recently deleted ones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules?includeDeleted=true
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Restore a deleted schedule slot (within the 7-day grace window)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/{{schedule_slot_id}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get staff group assignments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/staff-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get staff group assignments by group
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/staff-assignments?groupId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Assign staff to group
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/staff-assignments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "staffId": 1,
  "groupId": 1,
  "roleInGroup": "TEACHER",
  "primary": true,
  "startDate": "2026-08-15",
  "endDate": null
}
